  "details": "VRChat is, of course, primarily for VR, but it would be a nice functionality for PC users to be able to do basic movements of putting their arms up, out, and back to their default down position. It would help PC users be more expressive and be able to better gesture to items or have easier placement of objects. Movement at the elbow seems like too much to manage, but being able to move the entire straight arm would still be nice!",
